{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Dolls is a twin-stick shooter survival roguelite. You can play it as a traditional twin-stick shooter or as an auto-shooter for a more relaxed play style. Defend your neighborhood against an invasion of cute zombie aliens using a arsenal of guns, bombs, and melee weapons. Choose from a powerful selection of upgrades and special skills to enhance and develop your character.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPPORT US</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Dolls is still in development. If you have any questions or suggestions feel free to post on the community forum or reach out to us on X @TinyBruteStudio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to support us you can do so by wishlisting the game and providing feedback, which we would really appreciate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3033930?t=1772891329","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3033930?t=1772891329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772891329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772891329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Dolls is a twin-stick shooter survival roguelite. You can play it as a traditional twin-stick shooter or as an auto-shooter for a more relaxed play style. Defend your neighborhood against an invasion of cute zombie aliens using a arsenal of guns, bombs, and melee weapons. Choose from a powerful selection of upgrades and special skills to enhance and develop your character.</p><h2 class